    "publication_date": "2025-01-29",
    "description": "<p>Wave agitation data from the <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/43.341927,-8.507792\">Outer Port of Punta Langosteira</a> (A Coru&ntilde;a, Spain), recorded using an <a href=\"https://site.obscape.com/products/wave-monitoring/obs-buoy-400/\">OBS-Buoy400 Wave Buoy</a>.</p>\n<p>Includes significant wave height (Hs), maximum wave height (Hmax), and peak wave period (Tp) from Oct 2024 to Jan 2025.</p>",
